    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83173" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῑλ-ωτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">,
			ʽπιλόὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιλητός</span>
			, <i>of felt</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηναὶ π.</span>,
			of the Scythians, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				7.3.17
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιάρας περικείμενοι πιλωτάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					15.3.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>compressed</i>, = Lat. <i>densus</i>,
			Serv.Dan.ad Verg.<i><span class="en">
				<u>A.</u>
				12.121
			</span></i>.</div>
